{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. Robot finds an object, checks it, takes it, moves to destination, or approaches it, or scans. list of available nodes: <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    /> <Action ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <SubTree ID = ProcessObject    /> <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = MoveToDestination    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectApproached    />\"",
